# Publication working files
#
# `publication/` contains reviewed paper/thesis snapshots. Figure and table
# scripts write to `outputs/` by default; these rules hide legacy render
# caches, duplicate rasters, and superseded experiment snapshots without
# ignoring the canonical publication directory.
